  "prompt": "Cho hình chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có đáy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác đều cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>, cạnh bên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông góc với đáy. Tính khoảng cách từ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> theo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math>, biết <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.",
